                "description": "The Melrose Mortise Handleset features a classic look that will go well with new builds and historic renovations alike. This beautiful mortise front door lockset is available as a single cylinder handleset or a dummy function which is great for adding a matching set to the inactive side of a set of double doors. The Melrose Mortise Entrance Handleset comes in many stunning finishes.",
